From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:36:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] irqchip: route PCI MSI through GIC MBI SPIs

Port Droid-VM 2f3fcf217fbbcea0936b0f6398121ee0c6a9b57b to the
shared irqchip API. Register the SPI lines before Gunyah starts,
expose the existing frame at 0x7000, and route MSI-X events directly
to the selected line. Keep ITS and INTx behavior for other profiles.

BUG=None
TEST=ARM64 release build; MBI FDT and doorbell unit tests

Purpose: Route PCI MSI through GIC MBI SPIs.
Origin: Droid-VM/crosvm commits cited above.
Upstream-Status: Downstream GunyahVM carry; not submitted to crosvm upstream.
